  "post_content": "<p><span style=\"display: inline !important; float: none; background-color: transparent; color: rgb(29, 33, 41); font-family: Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\">(9 fotos y un v&iacute;deo) El accidente ha sido poco despu&eacute;s de las 15 horas de este viernes. K.S.P., de 20 ańos, ha perdido el control del BMW en el que viajaba solo por el Camino Viejo Onda-Castell&oacute;, en el pol&iacute;gono industrial, entre el restaurante El Colomer y Onix. </span></p><div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/accidentcotxecontracamioparatelcolomer/img_7292.jpg\" alt=\"img_7292\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/accidentcotxecontracamioparatelcolomer/img_7293.jpg\" alt=\"img_7293\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/accidentcotxecontracamioparatelcolomer/img_7295.jpg\" alt=\"img_7295\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/accidentcotxecontracamioparatelcolomer/img_7297.jpg\" alt=\"img_7297\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/accidentcotxecontracamioparatelcolomer/img_7301.jpg\" alt=\"img_7301\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/accidentcotxecontracamioparatelcolomer/img_7302.jpg\" alt=\"img_7302\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/accidentcotxecontracamioparatelcolomer/img_7304.jpg\" alt=\"img_7304\" style